# Common Module Guidelines

- Use Coroutines/Flow for asynchronous operations and state streams (`StateFlow`/`SharedFlow`).
- Utilize Ktor for networking and Kotlinx.serialization for JSON.
- For local storage, use Decompose, SQLDelight, or Room KMP.
- Keep UI-agnostic models clean from platform dependencies.